    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats, or unplanned weight loss; down about 1 kg with training</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing change; gums healthy after the dental cleaning</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, fainting, or ankle swelling, including on training walks</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heartburn, change in bowel habit, or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain with the training</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches, numbness, or weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
